(7733104, 1274319, 50695, '<td valign="top">i appreciate the experimentation. I would keep playing with this, though.<br/> <br/>just to clarify, i think you''re walking on an edge between a "safe" image and a daring image, with most of your composites. as a photographer I haven''t done any better with my few attempts, but speaking to you as a viewer, I feel this particular one isn''t sure whether it wants to be safe or daring. The face becomes just a sequence of lumps for eyes nose mouth. It''s kind of "muddy" without creating enough of an effect. imho</td>', 'i appreciate the experimentation. I would keep playing with this, though. just to clarify, i think you''re walking on an edge between a "safe" image and a daring image, with most of your composites. as a photographer I haven''t done any better with my few attempts, but speaking to you as a viewer, I feel this particular one isn''t sure whether it wants to be safe or daring. The face becomes just a sequence of lumps for eyes nose mouth. It''s kind of "muddy" without creating enough of an effect. imho', '2022-11-21 21:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
